{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in an infinite loop inside a movie theater trying to reach the right screening room.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird anomalies will occur. <i>Spot them</i>, run to get a new ticket, and keep going.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If your guess is right, you get closer to your movie room.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you get it wrong, you go back a few numbers\u2014unless you've stacked enough correct guesses to earn a shield in the cinema loyalty program.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/20040d871d9fef81cfdb73f995408ce0.poster.avif?t=1773696877\" width=410 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/20040d871d9fef81cfdb73f995408ce0.webm?t=1773696877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/20040d871d9fef81cfdb73f995408ce0.mp4?t=1773696877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO OMNIPLEX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Screening is a first-person horror anomaly-finding game set in a cinema venue. You will play as Susie, a movie fanatic who has just received a ticket to watch a film she\u2019s been eagerly awaiting. Use your finest perception skills to help Susie get to her film. The first run we guarantee your safety; after that, you are on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/308b895f612511ef45648982bedf4554.poster.avif?t=1773696877\" width=410 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/308b895f612511ef45648982bedf4554.webm?t=1773696877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/308b895f612511ef45648982bedf4554.mp4?t=1773696877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TERROR AWAITS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every scare comes from the screen. Monsters, weird voices, blood... You better watch out because it's all coming for you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/668ddb23a26cf5791a8ff6f869c1f9ca.poster.avif?t=1773696877\" width=410 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/668ddb23a26cf5791a8ff6f869c1f9ca.webm?t=1773696877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/668ddb23a26cf5791a8ff6f869c1f9ca.mp4?t=1773696877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY DETAIL MATTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trick is keeping your sanity whilst doing so. A big scare is not always a jump scare. Notice the subtle shifts or Susie may never make it to her seat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT ON HORROR LEGACY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Screening is inspired by find-anomalies games that present liminal spaces and psychological horror walking simulators, like '<i>The Exit 8</i>', '<i>The Cabin Factory'</i>, '<i>Hospital 666'</i>, and the old goodie <i>'P.T.'.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Anomaly Spotted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3632740/0fbceb812f50468ba4106476b4bbead76c705f83.jpg"},{"name":"Behind the Walls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3632740/26e178503ace84dc9b012db8132efb8b056cae30.jpg"},{"name":"Faced your Fears","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3632740/8fdbb71407ec35600574ebea5d6519d75c3e0186.jpg"},{"name":"Protective Measure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3632740/85f051a8b18db81faa5414b8fc1c31f5d28c3e79.jpg"},{"name":"Second Act","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3632740/8c257040d6284213cfc3cb74582204c4cb903949.jpg"},{"name":"Roll Credits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3632740/4972cfb55962d9c330bd42de11e23a787923a7dd.jpg"},{"name":"Final Cut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3632740/d183731004d1b4eb1ddbd320132383c6915e7950.jpg"},{"name":"Nothing Left Unseen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3632740/cd04748b7efd1b7aa3f6f90e0ebd2414819613cb.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3632740?t=1773696877","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/13bfec82aadd2b108e48017f642ac900dc8ff9bb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773696877","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/9e6660579bd8ab746742a3eed9ac0cdce7b950d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773696877","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/9e6660579bd8ab746742a3eed9ac0cdce7b950d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773696877","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains psychological themes including trauma, death, depression, and self-harm. Players will encounter disturbing imagery, unsettling audio (such as child laughter in eerie contexts), and moments of emotional intensity. The narrative explores loss, memory, identity, and inner conflict through a surreal, cinematic lens. Dialogue and scenes may allude to overdose, suicide, and mental breakdowns, presented in a metaphorical and symbolic environment.\r\n\r\nDiscretion is advised for players sensitive to these topics."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4004700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in an infinite loop inside a movie theater trying to reach the right screening room.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird anomalies will occur. <i>Spot them</i>, run to get a new ticket, and keep going.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If your guess is right, you get closer to your movie room.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you get it wrong, you go back a few numbers\u2014unless you've stacked enough correct guesses to earn a shield in the cinema loyalty program.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/20040d871d9fef81cfdb73f995408ce0.poster.avif?t=1773696877\" width=410 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/20040d871d9fef81cfdb73f995408ce0.webm?t=1773696877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/20040d871d9fef81cfdb73f995408ce0.mp4?t=1773696877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO OMNIPLEX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Screening is a first-person horror anomaly-finding game set in a cinema venue. You will play as Susie, a movie fanatic who has just received a ticket to watch a film she\u2019s been eagerly awaiting. Use your finest perception skills to help Susie get to her film. The first run we guarantee your safety; after that, you are on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/308b895f612511ef45648982bedf4554.poster.avif?t=1773696877\" width=410 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/308b895f612511ef45648982bedf4554.webm?t=1773696877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/308b895f612511ef45648982bedf4554.mp4?t=1773696877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TERROR AWAITS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every scare comes from the screen. Monsters, weird voices, blood... You better watch out because it's all coming for you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/668ddb23a26cf5791a8ff6f869c1f9ca.poster.avif?t=1773696877\" width=410 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/668ddb23a26cf5791a8ff6f869c1f9ca.webm?t=1773696877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/extras/668ddb23a26cf5791a8ff6f869c1f9ca.mp4?t=1773696877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY DETAIL MATTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trick is keeping your sanity whilst doing so. A big scare is not always a jump scare. Notice the subtle shifts or Susie may never make it to her seat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT ON HORROR LEGACY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Screening is inspired by find-anomalies games that present liminal spaces and psychological horror walking simulators, like '<i>The Exit 8</i>', '<i>The Cabin Factory'</i>, '<i>Hospital 666'</i>, and the old goodie <i>'P.T.'.</i></p>","developers":["Manguezal"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632740/65f9eebd92eeb2e684bae2ff8068241e7ee15b9a/header.jpg?t=1773696877","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3632740/1221048606/aa086d8e80c0742535bb6de47cd09f8f5c175fc7/1773655420/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773696875","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3632740/1221048606/aa086d8e80c0742535bb6de47cd09f8f5c175fc7/1773655420/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773696875","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3632740/1221048606/aa086d8e80c0742535bb6de47cd09f8f5c175fc7/1773655420/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773696875","id":257304326,"name":"Final Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257304326/e359adb0802597fa5bae7d2d02f28e21476f19f7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773696875"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3632740/1343456681/aa5f3334c4baf0a31